    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d417">

                <pb facs="0397" n="281" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg281"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 322.112J72.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic"> American Citizens at Guayaquil to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guayaquil</hi></placeName>, [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1914-03-03T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1914-03-01T00:00:00-05:14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date><hi rendition="#italic">; received March 3,
                            1914</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Jones, ex-Consul Guayaquil, imprisoned since December 17th without hope release.
                    Every attorney consulted considers extremely unlawful and groundless. We
                    American citizens request immediate protection. Consul Coding familiar with
                    case.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Yoder et al</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
